WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
A drug company invents a new medicine,

2
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.950
and patents it.

3
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.290
A patent normally lasts up to 20 years.

4
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.460
Until then, no rival may sell a copy.

5
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.010
So for those years,
the company is the only

6
00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.190
seller in the whole market.

7
00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.760
With no rivals at all,

8
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.700
why doesn't it just charge
as much as it likes?

9
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.000
In this mission, you'll build
the monopoly diagram and find

10
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.120
the price and output a monopolist chooses.

11
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.700
Then you'll slide output in a graph lab,

12
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.590
predict the most profitable point,

13
00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.900
and test it.

14
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:36.210
Your mission: find out how a
monopolist really chooses its price.
